        "version": 9,
        "title": "The Prism Observatory",
        "author": "Lantern Trails",
        "description": "Compass prisms turn old cards into new routes. Mirrors, repeated visits, bell duets and shared signals build toward the observatory.",
        "intro": "The finale: eight prisms, both mirror axes, a double reverse, two signal stamps and two tube pairs. X1 needs two activations; X5 needs four. Complete the first lap, power jade with a crate and yourself, then release jade and turn blue on for the last branch. Eight flags; one rewrite.",
        "ending": "The last prism folds the night into a single bright square. Inside the dome, Rook leaves an empty frame on the workbench. “Build the sky you want to explore.” Pip sets its three cards beside it. Tavi has already begun drawing a new door.",
        "hint": "Apply East / East / Use. Advance 29 cards. Push the crate west onto jade, then stand on the other jade plate. Advance 36 cards. Step north, turn the nearby blue wheel, then advance 13 cards. Pip parks on violet. Go around the crate, ring Home, restore the far light and return.",
